        "message": "SF-A05: repair integration contracts and complete qualification harnesses\n\nReconcile the tested main tree, restore strict ABI/root/schema checks, and fix source dispatch key admission and nested resource leases. Retain scoped frame reservations, guarded virtual cursors and source slice profiling dispatch.\n\nAdd complete byref and compiled-Wasm cold/warm timing harnesses and an actual-browser managed heap/GC case. Preserve all 312 native/browser results and failed performance observations.\n\nBroad A05 regression passes 3369 tests at local source 7d7fac37a; full A00 passes 482. Strict checks, license policy and build pass. Remaining current-head platform and fixed performance qualification remain explicit.\n\nLocal integration 9d46f4ad6f65bd7cbbed4a3a2f2e2abb9ddf763c; verified complete tree 08c3f8560c079bd5d370ef00dfa7529f3b936c10.",
